      "message": "kernel code can not be closed source, sorry, so that can not be an issue here, ESPECIALLY for anything dealing with hooks.\n\nI\u0027m going to abandon this now, it should be discussed further in the bug with more details.  This can not be taken as-is at this point in time.",
